e survey, it is estimated that $43%$ of people in the population support the ordinance, with an associated margin of error of $3%$.\n\nBased on these results, which of the following is a plausible value for the total number of people in the population who support the ordinance?" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209414 1072 #uuid "fecbb834-1e62-5fee-ad7a-21a7a163ca2e" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209415 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207779 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209415 1069 "q-307028" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209415 1071 "In $△ABC$, the measure of $∠A$ is $52^{∘}$, the measure of $∠B$ is $90^{∘}$, and the measure of $∠C$ is $(\\frac{z}{4})^{∘}$. What is the value of $z$?" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209415 1072 #uuid "fc7273d9-caa6-5433-b44f-7627429937ae" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209416 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207785 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209416 1069 "q-307037" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209416 1071 "In $△RST$, the measure of $∠R$ is $58^{∘}$, the measure of $∠S$ is $90^{∘}$, and the measure of $∠T$ is $(\\frac{z}{3})^{∘}$. What is the value of $z$?" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209416 1072 #uuid "b8ccf9c7-7f22-5c7a-984d-0fa451363956" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209417 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207791 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209417 1069 "q-307046" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209417 1071 "In the system of equations below, $m$ and $k$ are constants:\n\n${\\frac{3}{5}x - \\frac{1}{2}y = 4; mx - 2y = k$\n\nIf the system has an infinite number of solutions $(x, y)$, what is the value of $m$?" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209417 1072 #uuid "5b53defb-4032-5c63-a1dd-5b0151af0095" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209418 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207797 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209418 1069 "q-307050" 13194139533376 17592186045585 tr