$ |\n\nBased on the information in the table, how much greater, in terawatt-hours, was the median electricity generation in $2005$ than in $2001$, rounded to the nearest tenth of a terawatt-hour?\n\nThe median electricity generation in $2005$ was\n{{field-1}}\nterawatt-hours greater than in $2001$." 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209426 1072 #uuid "3b369d42-c41e-59ad-b6d2-9ea1e8a37447" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209427 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207841 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209427 1069 "q-307310" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209427 1071 "The results of two independent surveys are shown in the table below.\n\n| Teenagers' Daily Screen Time |  |  |  |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Group | Sample size | Mean ($hours$) | Standard deviation ($hours$) |\n| $A$ | $1, 200$ | $5.0$ | $1.4$ |\n| $B$ | $1, 200$ | $5.0$ | $2.3$ |\n\nWhich statement is true based on the table?\n\n1. Group $B$ included the teenager with the highest daily screen time.\n2. The Group $A$ data set was identical to the Group $B$ data set.\n3. The daily screen times in Group $B$ had a larger spread than those in Group $A$.\n4. The median daily screen time of Group $B$ is greater than the median daily screen time of Group $A$." 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209427 1072 #uuid "b9e606d7-6045-5e18-9c53-461a3b9fba3f" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209428 1068 #edb/ref 17592186207847 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209428 1069 "q-307365" 13194139533376 17592186045585 true] [17592186209428 1071 "The results of two independent surveys are shown in the table below.\n\n| Employees' Daily Emails Sent |  |  |  |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Group | Sample size | Mean ($emails$)$ | Standard deviation ($emails$)$ |\n| $C$ | $1, 050$ | $48$ | $11$ |\n| $H$ | $1, 050$ | $48$ | $15$ |\n\nWhich statement is true based on the table?\n\n1. Group $H$ included the employee with the highest daily emails sent.\n2